    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b4052c5477563f44f945915",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“胜利俱乐部”。\n是一家专门培育赛马娘的俱乐部，\n让赛马娘们能从小就接受参赛的训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d16b2114eeafd8a2ee7d7709b4beeaf9ded9859da210419122909512ffae2503",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
