      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这家俱乐部以气氛明快积极出名，\n旗下有多位以樱花为名的学员也是特征之一。",
      "source_fingerprint": "572d7974cb7b5352ac0de45ea5326392ef25bc61a583c35531fcdee02c0acf4c",
